            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A thumb? (ಹೆಬ್ಬೆರಳು, hebberaḷu.) A fingernail? (ಉಗುರು, uguru.) The chest? (ಎದೆ, ede.) The waist? (ಸೊಂಟ, soṇṭa.) An eyebrow? (ಹುಬ್ಬು, hubbu.) A table? (ಮೇಜು, mēju.) A window? (ಕಿಟಕಿ, kiṭaki.) A mirror? (ಕನ್ನಡಿ, kannaḍi.) A television? (ಟೀವಿ, ṭīvi.) A computer? (ಕಂಪ್ಯೂಟರ್, kampyūṭar.) A rupee? (ರೂಪಾಯಿ, rūpāyi.) A bottle? (ಬಾಟಲಿ, bāṭali.) A pocket? (ಜೇಬು, jēbu.) Socks? (ಸಾಕ್ಸ್, sāks.) A coat? (ಕೋಟು, kōṭu.) A lotus? (ಕಮಲ, kamala.) Wheat? (ಗೋಧಿ, gōdhi.) A boat? (ದೋಣಿ, dōṇi.) Tears? (ಕಣ್ಣೀರು, kaṇṇīru.) A moustache? (ಮೀಸೆ, mīse.)"
            }
